{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":45532,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793469568246,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2007,"episodeCount":25,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mXj8IzaAovQGYpUujMkZ4Fe9GWO.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"903440","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mihashi a freshman in high-school, and has just transferred to Nishiura High, a school not known for its baseball. But after he gets forced into playing by its new female coach, he befriends the the catcher Abe, who becomes his main supporter in the future.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-04-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cvFaHZZkuBsfw8Ow9ZWyZrpC3Ds.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cvFaHZZkuBsfw8Ow9ZWyZrpC3Ds.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"903444","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The baseball team at Nishiura High heads out to a training camp. As everyone is preparing for their first practice match against Mihashi's old school, Abe realizes that the catcher's role is not just on the field but is also to encourage and to protected the pitcher and his well-being.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-04-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/foVfk8tYPppJRMcer6g4ar4FdUq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/foVfk8tYPppJRMcer6g4ar4FdUq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"903443","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The practice game between Nishiura High and Mihoshi, Mihashi's old school, is about to start. However before the game starts Mihashi loses his confidence and runs behind the club building, Hatake, the catcher from Mihoshi, followed him and begins to harassing him to the point of threatening to break his arm for the lost games in middle-school.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-04-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/185vbfX0j1FHZx86Oy6AHB6UPHv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/185vbfX0j1FHZx86Oy6AHB6UPHv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"903445","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mihashi is pitching nicely, outing all of Mihoshi’s batters so far. At the top of the 2nd inning, Tajima easily hits Kanou’s forkball. Kanai tries to compete with Tajima and do the same, but strikes out instead.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4tGOjOgeU8MHjs30s5etLLWsPBK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4tGOjOgeU8MHjs30s5etLLWsPBK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"903442","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With nice team work, Nishiura is able to score two consecutive runs easily. Meanwhile, tension is rising between Kanou and the rest of his team.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8D8uWaUo9tdWkW9qlRmbB4qrYPA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8D8uWaUo9tdWkW9qlRmbB4qrYPA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"ht