903454","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"During practice, the team, with the addition of Hamada, continue to meditate, but this time start to actively train their relaxing reflex to trigger with the presence of a third base runner.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2HXo54mikvfRJXsngNCLk3JRgY8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2HXo54mikvfRJXsngNCLk3JRgY8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"903453","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The team has been working hard to prepare for the game against Tosei, to the point that even Shinooka-chan collapses from exhaustion because she had pulled an all-nighter writing a detailed report on Tosei’s battery and batters.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/11CPK4UfZnuFevcVDE1XrHPllkt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/11CPK4UfZnuFevcVDE1XrHPllkt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"903452","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The first game of the summer tournament begins. Everyone is present, including the big crowd that Hamada got to come to the game.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zK794b9j2zJkwaS4Hn3aXqEvAKa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zK794b9j2zJkwaS4Hn3aXqEvAKa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/epi