","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tajima once again strikes out, but is able to help his teammates successfully steal bases once he enters the coaching box again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-08-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6wDanIsoDR8vQpPR7iMMgf8LuVp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6wDanIsoDR8vQpPR7iMMgf8LuVp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"903462","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tosei takes several gamble plays and is able to get one more run in to take the lead once again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-09-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p5xmEARV95PGvWJprEN78OFpj1G.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5xmEARV95PGvWJprEN78OFpj1G.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"903463","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Nishiura is desperate now to get their batters onto the plates in order to have a chance at winning.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-09-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wfVj4zr1FigRcQLrilGbHz6G3bU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wfVj4zr1FigRcQLrilGbHz6G3bU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45532/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"903461","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Now that they have the lead, Nishiura must make sure that they don’t allow any more runs.","lang